"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.salutation}\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Wow, we are happy that you would like to take over CHF ${amount | int} of financial support for ${firstname}.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"% if not lsv_dd:\n"
"<p>In order for you to ${\"increase\" if payer else \"set up\"} your donation for the sponsorship,\n"
"you can find the payment slip here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Download payment slip</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"% endif\n"
"% if object.send_mode == \"digital\":\n"
